WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:04.600
Optional Reality — change the rules, choose the moment.

00:04.600 --> 00:08.300
Motion: type a rule, queue it, then start the rightward drift.

00:08.300 --> 00:12.300
Send leftward acceleration near the middle star. Momentum carries the ball onward before it turns.

00:12.300 --> 00:18.100
The ball returns to the exit. Three stars, full score.

00:18.100 --> 00:20.800
Chapter 2 — Collisions.

00:20.800 --> 00:25.200
Type “Set surface bounce to 1”, then Send now.

00:25.200 --> 00:29.500
The angled collision sends the ball upward with gravity still off. Three stars.

00:29.500 --> 00:32.300
Chapter 3 — Devices.

00:32.300 --> 00:36.200
Start with the toaster off. First contact pauses time and explains the mechanism.

00:36.200 --> 00:40.300
Type the power rule while paused. Send it, then choose Continue.

00:40.300 --> 00:45.300
Charge, launch, pickup — three stars. These recorded commands use local parsing.

00:45.300 --> 00:46.833
The demo repeats automatically.
